\item[S2] Tom Sanders, Green's sumset problem at density one half, arXiv:1003.5649; Acta Arith. 146 (2011), 91-101. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/1003.5649}. Bibliographic information imported from the supplied record.

\item[S3] Ben Green, 100 Open Problems, Problem 51, . \url{https://people.maths.ox.ac.uk/greenbj/papers/open-problems.pdf}. The author-hosted document was inspected on 27 September 2026; the archive’s local code is not a problem-number locator in this paper.

\item[S4] Formal Conjectures, Ben Green Open Problem 51. \url{https://firsching.ch/formal-conjectures/src/FormalConjectures/GreensOpenProblems/%C2%AB51%C2%BB/}. Bibliographic information imported from the supplied record.

\end{itemize}

}

